{"id":"n67866-1-20","stage":3,"title":"요청 · 要求","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67866-1-20-1","ko":"검찰에서 출석 요청이 왔습니다.","zh":"检方通知您前去接受调查。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"검찰에서","meaning":"检察，检察院","explanation":"검찰：检察，检察院；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"검찰","audio":"/audio/731edfabaf531fe83296.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30073","senseId":"1","lemma":"검찰","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"검찰에서","audio":"/audio/37c5c55bb787b2490f43.mp3"}},{"text":"출석","meaning":"出勤，出席，到场","explanation":"출석：出勤，出席，到场","readings":[{"term":"출석","audio":"/audio/6fe1c18a8a57574158a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79758","senseId":"1","lemma":"출석","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"출석","audio":"/audio/6fe1c18a8a57574158a0.mp3"}},{"text":"요청이","meaning":"要求，请求","explanation":"요청：要求，请求；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"요청","audio":"/audio/be41aba2fd84362ba49d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67866","senseId":"1","lemma":"요청","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요청이","audio":"/audio/ef7fb253a209c26b3672.mp3"}},{"text":"왔습니다.","meaning":"来，传来","explanation":"오다：来，传来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"6","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔습니다","audio":"/audio/a8b5d7f5825839e7e938.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"731edfabaf531fe8","term":"검찰","zh":"检察，检察院","audio":"/audio/731edfabaf531fe83296.mp3","entryId":"30073","definition":"调查犯罪事件，搜集证据，控告犯罪嫌疑人的工作；或指负责该项工作的政府机关。","pronunciation":["검ː찰"]},{"id":"6fe1c18a8a575741","term":"출석","zh":"出勤，出席，到场","audio":"/audio/6fe1c18a8a57574158a0.mp3","entryId":"79758","definition":"上课或参加聚会等。","pronunciation":["출썩"]},{"id":"be41aba2fd84362b","term":"요청","zh":"要求，请求","audio":"/audio/be41aba2fd84362ba49d.mp3","entryId":"67866","definition":"拜托干必要的事；或指那样的拜托。","pronunciation":["요청"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，传来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"消息或联系等被转达给某人。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b62e5cb12f80a154c6bc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67866-1-20-2","ko":"올 것이 왔군. 언제 오라고 하던가?","zh":"该来的终于来了，通知我什么时候去？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올","meaning":"来，到","explanation":"오다：来，到；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"8","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3"}},{"text":"것이","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것이","audio":"/audio/466d343bd03b56aac534.mp3"}},{"text":"왔군.","meaning":"来，到","explanation":"오다：来，到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；군：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"8","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔군","audio":"/audio/ea313cb73e57f4a2b377.mp3"}},{"text":"언제","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}},{"text":"오라고","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；라고：引用命令或名词判断；要与前后引用表达连用。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오라고","audio":"/audio/3a0f1ed7580815f00be6.mp3"}},{"text":"하던가?","m